This package is a fork of @stacksjs/ts-webp (https://github.com/stacksjs/ts-webp)
at the v0.1.6 release commit dfd79c9. Upstream ships no LICENSE file; its
package.json and README declare MIT, and LICENSE here carries the standard MIT
text for that grant.

The source is unchanged except that every relative import names its `.js`
file, and the package builds with tsc for NodeNext. Upstream's published
declarations omit those extensions, so under NodeNext resolution its exports
do not resolve and their types degrade to `any`.
Drop this fork when upstream publishes NodeNext-resolvable declarations.
